  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 988779b1-4445-49f9-a4e5-3f2dfa2588fa
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: "<h2 class=\"theme-module__editor-h2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 10px 0; color: #2E3D49;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">📊 Sales Performance Dashboard</span></h2><p class=\"theme-module__editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 15px; padding: 20px; background-color: #F8F9FA; border-left: 4px solid #4CAF50; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; color: #2E3D49;\"><strong>📈 Analysis Summary:</strong><br><br>✅ <strong>Time Series KPIs:</strong> Monthly and yearly sales trends show seasonal patterns with peak performance in 2023 ($281.8M) and strong recovery in 2024-2025. Monthly data reveals consistent performance with variations between $10-25M per month.<br><br>🌎 <strong>Regional Performance:</strong> West region leads with $335.9M in total sales, followed by East ($252.4M) and Midwest ($224.7M). Top performing stores include Nevada (89145) in West with $67.3M and New Jersey (07936) in East with $60.3M.<br><br>🏆 <strong>Key Insights:</strong> Regional performance varies significantly, with West and East regions driving the majority of sales. Top stores in each region show strong concentration of revenue, indicating successful local market penetration.<br><br><small style=\"color: #666; font-style: italic;\">Generated on March 27, 2026 16:24 UTC</small></span></p><div class=\"pinboard-note-tile-module__noteTileBg editor-module__bgNode\"></div>"
  - id: Viz_2
    answer:
      name: Show total sales by month as a time series KPI.
      tables:
      - id: (Sample) Retail - Apparel
        name: (Sample) Retail - Apparel
        obj_id: SampleRetail-Apparel-cd252e5c
      search_query: "[sales] [date].monthly"
      answer_columns:
      - name: Month(date)
      - name: Total sales
      table:
        table_columns:
        - column_id: Month(date)
          headline_aggregation: MIN-MAX
        - column_id: Total sales
          headline_aggregation: SUM
        ordered_column_ids:
        - Month(date)
        - Total sales
        client_state: ""
        client_state_v2: "{\"tableVizPropVersion\": \"V1\",\"columnProperties\": [{\"columnId\": \"Month(date)\",\"columnProperty\": {}},{\"columnId\": \"Total sales\",\"columnProperty\": {}}]}"
      chart:
        type: KPI
        chart_columns:
        - column_id: Month(date)
        - column_id: Total sales
        axis_configs:
        - x:
          - Month(date)
          "y":
          - Total sales
        client_state: ""
        client_state_v2: "{\"version\": \"V4DOT2\",\"chartProperties\": {\"gridLines\": {},\"responsiveLayoutPreference\": \"USER_PREFERRED_ON\",\"chartSpecific\": {\"dataFieldArea\": \"column\"}},\"columnProperties\": [{\"columnId\": \"Total sales\",\"columnProperty\": {}},{\"columnId\": \"Month(date)\",\"columnProperty\": {}}],\"axisProperties\": [{\"id\": \"d900325a-b30b-43fe-ac5f-953cf5f830cb\",\"properties\": {\"axisType\": \"Y\",\"linkedColumns\": [\"Total sales\"],\"isOpposite\": false}},{\"id\": \"4bd767e6-8daf-4b82-9766-2ea9858db242\",\"properties\": {\"axisType\": \"X\",\"linkedColumns\": [\"Month(date)\"]}}]}"
